@startuml
!include ../theme.puml
title Infrastructure Plane 组件图
left to right direction

rectangle "Kernel / L4 Port 调用方" as KERNEL LC_EXTERNAL
package "Infrastructure Plane" LC_INFRASTRUCTURE {
  component "StateStorage" as STATE
  component "ArtifactStorage" as ARTIFACT
  component "Process / Container" as PROCESS
  component "Transport" as TRANSPORT
  component "ModelEgress" as EGRESS
  component "SecretResolver" as SECRET
  component "Clock / Time" as CLOCK
}

KERNEL --> STATE : Repository Ports
KERNEL --> ARTIFACT : ArtifactPort
KERNEL --> PROCESS : Process / Container Ports
KERNEL --> TRANSPORT : TransportPort
KERNEL --> EGRESS : ModelEgressPort
KERNEL --> SECRET : SecretResolverPort
KERNEL --> CLOCK : ClockPort

note bottom of STATE
  Infrastructure 只返回机制结果和不透明 Handle；
  不定义 Agent、Run、调度、权限、工具或业务规则。
end note
@enduml
